{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122040","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1012204001:0":{"text":"이 허니리프베어와 계속 있어야 해요? 울음소리가 엄청 큰데, 친구라도 부르면 어떡해요...","source_cn":"咱还要跟这头叶角熊耗下去吗？它叫得太响了，我怕它会引来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB149ADD95612EDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012204002:0":{"text":"쫄기는! 고작 허니리프베어 한 마리에 벌벌 떠는 거야?","source_cn":"看你那怂样！区区一只叶角熊你也怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8948D8E75734074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012204003:0":{"text":"이 녀석은 보통내기가 아니야. 계속 자신을 공격하면서 고통으로 이성을 유지하고 있어. 난 이렇게 자신에게 가혹한 녀석이 좋더라!","source_cn":"这家伙还挺顽强，它一直在攻击自己，用痛苦维持理智。我就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1E644B136DD7C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012204004:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">알약</style>은 더 있어? 서둘러서 더 가져와. 녀석이 곧 굴복할 것 같으니까!","source_cn":"<style=highlight>小药丸</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B2650A65389A465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012204005:0":{"text":"없어요, 두목… 아시다시피 금빛이삭 마을에 소란이 있었잖아요. 바인 머스캣이 부족해진 탓에 상회로부터 알약 공급이 힘들어졌어요.","source_cn":"没了头儿……你也知道，金穗村那边出了点乱子，藤水晶不够...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6E96F99226CC71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012204006:0":{"text":"또 가증스러운 블랙골드 상회야… 대체 허니리프에게 뭘 먹인거지!","source_cn":"又是可恶的黑金商会……他们给叶角熊吃了什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B2A796891DB566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012204007:0":{"text":"엄청 고통스러워 보여… 설마 휴윈이 말한 친구가 저 허니리프베어인가?","source_cn":"那只叶角熊很痛苦……难道伊温说的朋友，是这只叶角熊吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64397B315680894A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012204008:0":{"text":"그런 것 같아, 온순한 털북숭이라고 했으니, 평소의 허니리프베어를 말한 거였어!","source_cn":"错不了，伊温说他的朋友很温柔，还是个毛绒绒，那不就是平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB84DF798DB0CED0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012204009:0":{"text":"저들이 생명을 해치도록 놔둘 수 없어, 가자!","source_cn":"不能任凭这些人伤害生灵，上吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AE6FC9ED855F41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:胆小的男人":{"text":"겁이 많은 남자","source":"胆小的男人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:凶恶的男人":{"text":"험상궂은 남자","source":"凶恶的男人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":5}}